ttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1h4_vm9LJic_OyvnG-SQc9jqtrND910mt\n\n気軽に楽しんで、読んでくれてありがとうございます！今日も良い一日になりますように！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_400007/works/103", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c4be95e1/uploads/origins/fccf4557-e265-4314-9e44-db54a25157ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fc6a884ee98c8e89008ad07a99fbad5f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c4be95e1/uploads/origins/fccf4557-e265-4314-9e44-db54a25157ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fc6a884ee98c8e89008ad07a99fbad5f, https://si.imgix.net/c4be95e1/uploads/origins/fccf4557-e265-4314-9e44-db54a25157ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f6f4842b927c6da138e7cd74de19d682 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c4be95e1/uploads/origins/fccf4557-e265-4314-9e44-db54a25157ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0974d55b7dac38ad9eb7eae264c35069 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you. \n\nI would like to request my FFXIV OC, Iszy. Please draw him as smug as  you like.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/aF8bLRF < Please make sure to take note of his horns on the side of his head and the top.\n\nPlease draw him in whatever outfit you like. He usually likes dark clothing, like leather jackets and ripped jeans.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_400007/works/102", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/45da3865/uploads/origins/1f2ee3c2-4d4c-4b97-b13c-982f0723d94d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b3cd7cdafcb03b457e7e6500a306756", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/45da3865/uploads/origins/1f2ee3c2-4d4c-4b97-b13c-982f0723d94d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b3cd7cdafcb03b457e7e6500a306756, https://si.imgix.net/45da3865/uploads/origins/1f2ee3c2-4d4c-4b97-b13c-982f0723d94d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=